.Sh NAME

.Nm pwd
.Nd print the current working directory

.Sh SYNOPSIS

.Nm
.Op Fl LP

.Sh DESCRIPTION

.Nm
prints the path of the current working directory.

.Sh OPTIONS

.Bl -tag -width Ds

.It Fl L

logical path, uses
.Ev PWD .
default option.

.It Fl P

physical path, avoids all symlinks.

